<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTO V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTO V ROSENBORG TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Champions' League group D match between Porto and Rosenborg of Norway:</p>
<p>Porto - 24-Henrique Hilario; 2-Joao Pinto, 4-Aloisio Alves, 5-Fernando Mendes, 8-Rui Barros, 11-Ljubimko Drulovic, 14-Artur Oliveira, 20-Paulinho Santos, 21-Edmilson Pimenta, 22-Jorge Costa, 25-Zlatko Zahovic.</p>
<p>Rosenborg - 1-Jorn Jamtfall; 3-Eric Hoftun, 4-Bjorn Otto Bragstad, 5-Stale Stensaas, 6-Roar Strand, 8-Bent Skammelsrud, 10-Harald Brattbakk, 14-Vegard Heggem, 16-Steffen Iversen, 18-Bjorn Kvarme, 20-Trond Soltvedt</p>
